I developed a scalable voice AI system enabling natural conversations with retail visitors about property preferences. The system processes speech in real-time, maintains conversation context, and delivers personalized property recommendations from HUSPY's database.

Technical components include acoustic models optimized for retail environments, GPT-based conversational agents, sqlite session management, vector similarity search, and edge deployment achieving sub-200ms latency. The system was purpose-built for real estate terminology and buyer qualification workflows.\
\
The room scale projection technology was provided by [Ubicuity .](https://ubicuity.com/)

